The web music track is an HTMLAudioElement. Each track registered a one-shot
pointerdown/keydown play() even when autoplay had worked, never removed it on
a track change or stop, and only removed src from the replaced element, which
keeps the loaded resource. The portal's automatic login has no gesture, so the
first click or key in the Field resumed the login music under the zone music
(issue #42). Now the gesture retry is registered only when autoplay is blocked,
plays only the current unstopped track, is removed on replace and stop, and a
replaced element is unloaded with load(). Windows build unchanged.

